    windows_phase3_blocked_planner_admission_producer_requires_in_repo_build_root_2026-09-02, 2, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/windows_phase3_blocked_planner_admission_producer_requires_in_repo_build_root_2026-09-02.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."
    windows_phase3_blocked_planner_admission_producer_requires_in_repo_build_root_2026-09-02, 4, "2026-11-09 p3-subj6: FIXED by re-verification on release/1.0.0. Unblock condition 1 landed: producer binds admission residency to declared --bootstrap-output (line 180) with SIMPLE_BOOTSTRAP_BUILD_ROOT override and explicit external-output allowlist. Unblock condition 2 landed: resume-stage3-from-admitted.sh has exe_suffix/.lib/MSVC env (lines 120-141). Pre-existing gate fixture drift also fixed. Executed: check-bootstrap-planner-admission-producer.shs PASS — 19 fixture(s) checked (sibling-output refusal + allowlisted external-output acceptance). Not executed: real Windows Phase-3 run (no Windows host/native builds in lane). Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/windows_phase3_blocked_planner_admission_producer_requires_in_repo_build_root_2026-09-02.md Re-verification 2026-11-09"

